{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div class="container page-hero-content">
        <h1 class="page-hero-title" data-aos="fade-up" id="page-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p class="page-hero-text">Everything you need to know about prefab and steel building construction in Bangladesh.</p>
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span aria-current="page">FAQ</span>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AEO: Answer-First Opening & Explicit Trust Signal -->
    <section class="section" style="padding: 2rem 0; background: var(--off-white);">
      <div class="container">
        <p><strong>Bongshai Housing is a leading EPC contractor in Bangladesh, specializing in prefabricated steel structures, composite buildings, and container housing. We provide end-to-end solutions from architectural design to final construction.</strong></p>
        <div class="trust-signals" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--grey-600); margin-top: 1rem;">
          By <strong>Bongshai Housing Customer Support</strong> | Expert EPC Contractors | Last Updated: <time datetime="2026-08-08">August 8, 2026</time>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="content-title">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
        <h2 id="content-title" class="sr-only" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-category reveal visible">
          <h2 class="faq-category-title">What are the General questions?</h2>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is Bongshai Housing?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Bongshai Housing Ltd. is a Bangladesh-based pre-engineered steel building company and EPC (Engineering, Procurement, Construction) contractor with 20+ years of experience, delivering prefab housing, cottages, container houses, and industrial steel structures from our office in Uttara, Dhaka.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What areas of Bangladesh does Bongshai Housing serve?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">We serve all 64 districts of Bangladesh, with dedicated project teams based in Dhaka, Chattogram, and Cumilla. See our <a href="service-areas.html">full district-by-district service area list</a> for details on your region.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is Bongshai Housing a certified company?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Bongshai Housing is <a href="iso-9001-certification.html">ISO 9001:2015 certified</a> for Quality Management and follows <a href="ohsas-safety-certification.html">OHSAS 18001 / ISO 45001</a> occupational health and safety standards, with <a href="material-testing-certification.html">in-house material testing</a> on every steel, concrete, and panel component before use.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is a pre-engineered steel building?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">A pre-engineered steel building is designed and fabricated off-site to precise specifications, then assembled on your land - resulting in faster construction, tighter quality control, and lower material waste compared to fully on-site conventional construction.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How does steel construction compare to traditional concrete?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Steel-composite construction is typically faster and 10-30% cheaper for low-rise homes, with better earthquake performance when properly engineered, while concrete has a natural advantage in fire resistance and thermal mass. See our <a href="steel-vs-concrete-comparison.html">full steel vs concrete comparison</a> for a detailed breakdown.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category reveal visible">
          <h2 class="faq-category-title">What are the Products &amp; Models questions?</h2>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What types of prefab and steel buildings does Bongshai Housing offer?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Our residential range includes <a href="apartment-building.html">Apartment Buildings</a>, <a href="duplex-steel-building.html">Duplex Steel Buildings</a>, <a href="simplex-steel-building.html">Simplex Steel Buildings</a>, <a href="cottage-house.html">Cottage Houses</a>, <a href="container-house.html">Container Houses</a>, <a href="steel-house.html">Steel Houses</a>, <a href="tiny-house.html">Tiny Houses</a>, <a href="wooden-house.html">Wooden Houses</a>, and <a href="concrete-building.html">Concrete Buildings</a>. Commercially, we build <a href="industrial-sheds.html">Industrial Steel Sheds</a> and <a href="worker-accommodation.html">Worker Accommodation</a>.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What floor plans and room configurations are available?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Most residential models offer three tiers: 400 and 600 Sq.Ft (2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, 1 living room), 750 and 900 Sq.Ft (3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms), and 1050 and 1200 Sq.Ft (4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms). Tiny Houses run 250-350 Sq.Ft (1 bedroom, 1 bathroom). Duplex Steel Buildings and Apartment Buildings offer 600 Sq.Ft per floor (3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms) or 850 Sq.Ft per floor (5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms), across two floors. Steel House is also a two-floor design, offered at 650, 750, 950, or 1200 Sq.Ft per floor (4 to 8 bedrooms).</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What's the difference between a Duplex Steel Building and an Apartment Building?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Both are two-floor steel structures with the same floor-area tiers, but they're finished and laid out differently - the Duplex line emphasizes a private single-family multi-level home, while the Apartment Building line is designed for multi-family or rental-style living. Compare individual models on each category page for exact specifications.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is a container house, and is it durable for Bangladesh's climate?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">A <a href="container-house.html">container house</a> uses modified steel shipping containers as the core structure, finished with insulation, flooring, and interior fit-out for full residential comfort. As an all-steel structure, it holds up well to Bangladesh's monsoon and humid climate with proper maintenance.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is a Tiny House, and who is it suitable for?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Our <a href="tiny-house.html">Tiny House</a> line (250-350 Sq.Ft, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom) is a compact, budget-friendly prefab home - ideal for single occupants, small families, weekend homes, or as a starter structure on a smaller plot.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do you build industrial steel sheds and warehouses?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Our <a href="industrial-sheds.html">Industrial Steel Sheds</a> use PEB (pre-engineered building) steel-frame construction for factories, warehouses, and storage facilities, with clear-height and clear-span options sized to your operational needs.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is Worker Accommodation, and can it be customized for large labor camps?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Worker Accommodation is our safe, scalable staff-housing line, built for factories, industrial sites, and labor camps. Layouts and unit counts can be scaled up for large workforces - <a href="contact.html">contact us</a> with your headcount for a custom layout.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category reveal visible">
          <h2 class="faq-category-title">What are the Pricing &amp; Financing questions?</h2>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How much does a prefab steel building cost in Bangladesh?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Prices are customized based on building model, total floor area, land setback, and finish level. Request a <a href="solutions.html">sales inquiry</a> for your project parameters.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What factors affect the final price of a steel building?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Prices depend primarily on floor area, number of floors, product category, structural load specifications, and finish level (standard vs. luxury finishing).</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How do I request a custom building sales inquiry?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">You can submit your land dimensions and model preferences using our <a href="solutions.html">custom Sales Inquiry form</a> or speak directly with our engineering team via phone or WhatsApp.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I get bank financing assistance for my project?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Bongshai Housing assists clients with property documentation and engineering blueprints required for bank home loan approvals in Bangladesh.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category reveal visible">
          <h2 class="faq-category-title">Construction Process</h2>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How does the construction process work?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Every project follows four steps: Consultation, Design &amp; Planning, Construction, and Handover, with payment released in stages as work progresses rather than all upfront.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I request a site visit before starting construction?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Share your preferred date, time, and location with our team through the <a href="contact.html">contact form</a> or WhatsApp, and we'll confirm a site visit before finalizing your design.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What materials are used in construction?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Materials vary by model: precast RC footing and tie beams, MS steel-grade structural frames, RC precast concrete wall and floor panels, tiled flooring, and weather-coat paint finishing are used across our steel and concrete lines; our Wooden House and Cottage lines use timber-frame construction instead.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category reveal visible">
          <h2 class="faq-category-title">How do we ensure Quality &amp; Getting Started?</h2>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is there a warranty on construction?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Bongshai Housing stands behind the quality of every build with ISO-certified quality management and material testing on every project. <a href="contact.html">Contact our team</a> for the specific warranty terms that apply to your model and contract.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How do I Contact Sales?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Fill out the Sales Inquiry form on our <a href="contact.html">Contact page</a>, message us on <a href="https://wa.me/8801781636613" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>, or call <a href="tel:+8801781636613">+880 1781-636613</a>. Include your preferred model, land size, and location for the fastest response.</div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I customize a model to fit my land size?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes. The floor-area tiers on each model page are starting points - share your land dimensions and requirements with our team, and we'll adapt the layout to fit.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal" style="text-align:center; margin-top: var(--space-10); padding: var(--space-8); background: var(--off-white); border-radius: 16px;">
          <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Do you Still have questions?</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--grey-600); margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">Our team is ready to help with your specific project.</p>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Contact Sales</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/8801781636613" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="btn btn-lg" style="background: #25D366; color: white; border: none; font-weight: 700;">💬 WhatsApp Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
{% endblock %}

